=== Part B, item 8: external baseline comparison (BatteryLife's own published benchmark) ===

TASK/METRIC MISMATCH, stated up front: BatteryLife's benchmark = early-cycle-life (EOL-cycle) prediction from the first <=100 cycles, scored by MAPE/15%-Acc. This project's protocol = continuous per-cycle SOH regression, scored by R2/RMSE. NOT the same task - no single number below should be read as 'beats' or 'loses to' the other.

